From 59aa0533e2ee18c91734de0d2fc58ae732dfae6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 14:26:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore: suppress unused-code warnings in FuelStation.kt

Amenities/PaymentMethod enums, ratings, and several helper methods on
FuelStation aren't wired into the UI yet (only price/status/wait-time are
used by FuelDispatcher today). This is an intentional MVP domain-model
surface for planned features (station detail card, map filters), not dead
code from a refactor -- so suppress rather than delete, to avoid losing the
scoped-out functionality and to keep IDE inspection signal focused on real
issues elsewhere in the project.
---
 .../com/navrot/aifuelassistant/domain/fuel/FuelStation.kt   | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/navrot/aifuelassistant/domain/fuel/FuelStation.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/navrot/aifuelassistant/domain/fuel/FuelStation.kt
index d31ab1b..bb54e79 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/com/navrot/aifuelassistant/domain/fuel/FuelStation.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/com/navrot/aifuelassistant/domain/fuel/FuelStation.kt
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+// Часть этой модели (amenities, способы оплаты, ряд методов) пока не подключена
+// к UI — это осознанно оставленный задел на будущее (карточка АЗС, фильтры на карте),
+// а не мёртвый код после рефакторинга. Подавляем лишний шум от IDE-инспекции "unused",
+// чтобы не терять сигнал по реальным проблемам в остальном проекте.
+@file:Suppress("unused")
+
 package com.navrot.aifuelassistant.domain.fuel
 
 import java.time.Instant
-- 
